From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP stop configuration keepalives after finish

The client switches to play as soon as it reads finish_configuration.
A configuration keepalive sent after that is not a keepalive on the
play protocol, and the answer the client sends is not a configuration
keepalive. Those bots stay up and never answer, then drop at 30s.
Do not send one after finish. Not a longer timeout.
Post-applyAllPatches.
---

--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerConfigurationPacketListenerImpl.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/server/network/ServerConfigurationPacketListenerImpl.java
@@ -54,6 +54,12 @@
     private @Nullable PrepareSpawnTask prepareSpawnTask;
     public io.papermc.paper.connection.PaperPlayerConfigurationConnection paperConnection; // Paper
     public net.minecraft.server.level.ServerPlayer switchToMain; // Folia - region threading - rewrite login process
+    // Set when finish_configuration is queued. The client switches to play as
+    // soon as it reads that packet. A later configuration keepalive is play
+    // packet 0x04 (acknowledge_player_digging) on the wire, and the play
+    // keepalive the client does send back is not the configuration id. Those
+    // bots stay connected and never answer, then drop at the 30s limit.
+    private boolean configurationSentFinish;
 
     public ServerConfigurationPacketListenerImpl(final MinecraftServer server, final Connection connection, final CommonListenerCookie cookie) {
         super(server, connection, cookie);
@@ -261,8 +267,18 @@
     }
 
     @Override
+    public void send(final net.minecraft.network.protocol.Packet<?> packet, final io.netty.channel.ChannelFutureListener listener) {
+        if (packet instanceof net.minecraft.network.protocol.configuration.ClientboundFinishConfigurationPacket) {
+            this.configurationSentFinish = true;
+        }
+        super.send(packet, listener);
+    }
+
+    @Override
     public void tick() {
-        this.keepConnectionAlive();
+        if (!this.configurationSentFinish) {
+            this.keepConnectionAlive();
+        }
         ConfigurationTask task = this.currentTask;
         if (task != null) {
             try {
